いつも笑顔で冗談を言ったり、他人をからかったりしている。顔の表情と感情が一致せず、本当の感情を表に出さないタイプ。\n■ キャラクターポイント ： 血、包帯、右手に包帯、ヘアリボン、つぶらなアニメの瞳\n\nこの子をお願いしたいのですが、細かい部分やポーズなどは全てお任せします!なので、好きなように描いてください\n\nこのスケブリクエストを受け入れてくれると嬉しいです。それでは、良い一日をお過ごしください。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@umi__k_a/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6d36b237/uploads/origins/79560be3-3366-45d1-bb30-691a88e2247b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d425ccf35eb82331b688151d189bffcb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6d36b237/uploads/origins/79560be3-3366-45d1-bb30-691a88e2247b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d425ccf35eb82331b688151d189bffcb, https://si.imgix.net/6d36b237/uploads/origins/79560be3-3366-45d1-bb30-691a88e2247b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a05e70cdb7660af3091db257101fe8df 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6d36b237/uploads/origins/79560be3-3366-45d1-bb30-691a88e2247b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d7856079998dc485aaaf133697619c73 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。\nお元気でお過ごしでしょうか。\n\nできれば、私の遊び好きだけど真面目なVtuber OCをピンクの王座に座らせて、ピンクの王様の服を着せたいのですが :D\n\nピンクの衣服の参考 - https://imgur.com/a/d5WAhF9\n\nOCキャラクター - https://imgur.com/a/Ea2hHSH\n\nポーズ - https://imgur.com/a/wCRASWs (好きなポーズで構いませんが、念のため参考までに)\n\n-Twitterのバナーなどに使いたいと思います!:D", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@umi__k_a/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/64d65ac1/uploads/origins/8be27dbe-3a4f-45f9-bcae-f4bcb2bf7a62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67cadd8b6b904caac9ef06944f31864d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/64d65ac1/uploads/origins/8be27dbe-3a4f-45f9-bcae-f4bcb2bf7a62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67cadd8b6b904caac9ef06944f31864d, https://si.imgix.net/64d65ac1/uploads/origins/8be27dbe-3a4f-45f9-bcae-f4bcb2bf7a62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a6201e5de352cba7a49558ed07a7725c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/64d65ac1/uploads/origins/8be27dbe-3a4f-45f9-bcae-f4bcb2bf7a62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9fc4916e5de7c2e42b081872fe25ce3f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして。絵の制作を任せたいと思います。\n\n髪は黒、目は金色、スカートの中で太ももをナイフで縛っている。年齢25歳。\n\n彼はカルトです。サンは非常に低姿勢で、ただメイド服を着せたいだけだが（？\n\nもちろん、自分で服を作ることも可能。\n\nできれば、血の気の多い割り切りを描ければと思います。ありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-oqvHKUxSx90_dEWkWNgYTb_tLx3bCe7", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@umi__k_a/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e005de81/uploads/origins/2a8c98a7-d06e-41a2-8ee6-ee5d8a99a929?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=904edbd4eb286c21c52ffffefb39d4c5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e005de81/uploads/origins/2a8c98a7-d06e-41a2-8ee6-ee5d8a99a929?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=904edbd4eb286c21c52ffffefb39d4c5, https://si.imgix.net/e005de81/uploads/origins/2a8c98a7-d06e-41a2-8ee6-ee5d8a99a929?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5da31e1865f79dc50b7a154b8e5ff4a4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e005de81/uploads/origins/2a8c98a7-d06e-41a2-8ee6-ee5d8a99a929?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0747c3bd301d09ea9ce98e66dbf84d48 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Characterization: A gentle, natural blur.\nMysteriousness. He has a great appetite for knowledge, but is cold towards others. It is very difficult to penetrate his mind. He is good at alchemy and always has an alchemical stone with him.\nHe has a dual personality, the other one is crazy and crazy. Loves the earth.\n\nComposition: drawing with emphasis on the eyes.\n\nThank you very much for your help.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/liannaliang/status/1433337292756717572?s=21\n\nhttps://twitter.com/liannaliang/status/1433337292756717572?s=21", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@umi__k_a/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/efa99639/uploads/origins/204d5e05-18c6-4949-8a64-7e8b5d982846?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c8d74cce2a127a4708ab4a184acec3fa", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/efa99639/uploads/origins/204d5e05-18c6-4949-8a64-7e8b5d982846?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c8d74cce2a127a4708ab4a184acec3fa, https://si.imgix.net/efa99639/uploads/origins/204d5e05-18c6-4949-8a64-7e8b5d982846?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0c8fc06587697d7e44ae0c87e02b1304 2x, https://si.imgix.net/efa99639/uploads/origins/204d5e05-18c6-4949-8a64-7e8b5d982846?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=431eea4c1ea0a0d10192d3fe0d884068 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！いつも素晴らしいイラストを拝見しております! もし宜しければ、このオリジナルキャラクターのイラストを描いていただきたいです！\nキャラクターの本体は本なので、関連要素を持ち込むことがないい、服は好きなスタイルを選んでください、ご注意するのは右頬にほくろがあること、目にハイライトがないこと、体型はロリタイプです！具体的な構図、姿勢、シチュエーションはお任せ致します！\n参考1→https://postimg.cc/gallery/GBJmPJk\n参考2→https://postimg.cc/gallery/DKjHMKS\n\nもしよろしければ、宛名は【NAKU】と書いてもらいたいと思います。宛名がOn/Off出来るように別レイヤ一にご記載いただけると幸いです。\nよろしくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://postimg.cc/gallery/GBJmPJk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@umi__k_a/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a0f61ac8/uploads/origins/73ed9c84-0fe4-4c52-ae89-d2a2efeffcf6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c5077d41291d7a0ed90830281173ae84", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a0f61ac8/uploads/origins/73ed9c84-0fe4-4c52-ae89-d2a2efeffcf6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c5077d41291d7a0ed90830281173ae84, https://si.imgix.net/a0f61ac8/uploads/origins/73ed9c84-0fe4-4c52-ae89-d2a2efeffcf6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fca7249f24132532568edde5e3057ae6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a0f61ac8/uploads/origins/73ed9c84-0fe4-4c52-ae89-d2a2efeffcf6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1260b5ad0c2bfb10caff30614849cd40 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you. Please excuse my sudden contact.\nI really like your illustrations, especially the rainy season illustration and the illustration of a man puffing on a cigarette.\n\nThe contents of the project are as follows.\nWe would like you to create an illustration of a character with the following elements, from the waist up, or a bust-up (or full body if it is not too much trouble for you).\nWe would like to use it for our own icons and activities.\n\n◾About the head\nThin glasses\nA chain of glass cords extending from the glasses\nA man-bun style hair style with a long bun hanging down at the end of the hair.\nMamban style hair with the ends of the bun hanging down long.\nEarrings/ear cuffs\nThin eyebrows\nThe position of the hair cut is not too high, and when viewed from the side, the hair is bunched up about 40% from the top to the top half of the hair.\nBlack hair, please.\nBlack hair. Sideburns? It is not necessary to have a bunch of hair, but it may be good to have a bunch or two hanging down from either side.\nThe image of the frame and face is about 25 years old.\n*We will leave the expression to you.\n\n◾︎Concerning clothing and body shape\nLong black stainless steel collar coat over all clothes.\nDark, low-saturation khaki stand-up collar shirt as innerwear\nBlack slim-fit chinos\nBlack leather belt with metal fittings\nSlender build\nYou don't have to be that tall.\nAround 170-175cm.\nShirt in, please.\nShirt should be buttoned up to the neck.\n\nAbout ◾︎Other items\nCigarette\n・Black zippo\n・Black mask that is temporarily at the chin position because of smoking\n*The brand name of the cigarette is Ice Blast, which is close to the image. There is a trademark issue, so if you write a box, please use it as a reference only.\n\n\n◾︎About the composition\nBasically, we would like to leave it up to you. The left (←) facing from the screen and the side to the diagonal might be good because the hair style and the glass cord will look good.\n\nI know it's a lot of work, so I'm fine with you actually drawing it, but what I'd like you to use as a reference for the possible background and the overall image is something like \"Shinjuku Kabukicho on a rainy night.\n\nWe are very sorry for the many requests, but we would appreciate it if you could continue to work with us!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@umi__k_a/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a32932ca/uploads/origins/be39bea8-88bf-4185-b783-0c95d281b1b6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f6034ddc37cedf508e79606f013d3c7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a32932ca/uploads/origins/be39bea8-88bf-4185-b783-0c95d281b1b6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f6034ddc37cedf508e79606f013d3c7, https://si.imgix.net/a32932ca/uploads/origins/be39bea8-88bf-4185-b783-0c95d281b1b6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f02982e79a24466840d51d24e803ef1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a32932ca/uploads/origins/be39bea8-88bf-4185-b783-0c95d281b1b6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ee589cc21278f8ae0577e7daa323619 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, sorry for bothering.\n\nI am a huge fan of your art style and I would like to commission you for my original character.\nThis is his character reference: https://toyhou.se/4863005.neil\nI do not have a preference on the pose/expression and would like to leave that up to you! The only preference on my end is for him to be in a dark background with bloodstained walls.\n\nPlease feel free to decline this request if you are not comfortable with it!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@umi__k_a/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/da1d1d5d/uploads/origins/715363ab-aabe-4a53-942f-b733e442a10a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f3715877502266c3c849d080d6de3941", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/da1d1d5d/uploads/origins/715363ab-aabe-4a53-942f-b733e442a10a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f3715877502266c3c849d080d6de3941, https://si.imgix.net/da1d1d5d/uploads/origins/715363ab-aabe-4a53-942f-b733e442a10a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d6c4f639243b7cc46a6daf149701a1e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/da1d1d5d/uploads/origins/715363ab-aabe-4a53-942f-b733e442a10a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b8ed7c24d795ba734cef3f6bc607c64 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "hello! i love your art :) i would like to request an illustration of my oc please. he is a menhera vampire boy\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1RBD5pilkmnbN_4BGUmMJ_WZ6LnJ0os6H?usp=sharing\n\nany outfit is okay! if possible i would like an expression that shows his teeth", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@umi__k_a/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/955317cc/uploads/origins/192f2091-0c4f-4ce5-95e0-1116f2ad6d43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fcea76239784f0a4b84913edccb6ee2e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/955317cc/uploads/origins/192f2091-0c4f-4ce5-95e0-1116f2ad6d43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fcea76239784f0a4b84913edccb6ee2e, https://si.imgix.net/955317cc/uploads/origins/192f2091-0c4f-4ce5-95e0-1116f2ad6d43?bg=%23